Scope of this license

This license covers the code in this repository (the .py and .js files and the
build files) written by UnluckyManDev.

It does NOT cover the game or anything taken from it. The story, characters,
names and artwork of 植物大战僵尸恐怖版 belong to its creators (Bilibili creator
对不起贱笑了 and the TaoYuan team), and Plants vs. Zombies belongs to PopCap
Games / Electronic Arts. The translations and redrawn images in source/data/ are
fan-made translations of that work and are shared only so the game can be played
in English.
